abstract: >-
  Reproducible workflow for nominal ECM gene-set representation checks in a
  TempO-Seq WHT reference export and synthetic DESeq2/GSVA-ssGSEA integration tests.
  This is a technical feasibility study, not PSCC biological or clinical validation.
